Ogham’s vertical intrinsic direction is **bottom-to-top (btt)**, with a **−90° counter-clockwise transform**.

CSS Writing Modes Level 3 cannot automatically handle Ogham’s bottom-to-top orientation. The recommended approach is:

```css
.ogham {
  writing-mode: vertical-lr;
  text-orientation: sideways-left;
}
```

This lays the Ogham text out vertically from bottom to top.
